Cell["Ford-Fulkerson Algorithm (Maximum Flow / Minimum Cut)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.483284400214715*^9, 3.483284427755842*^9}},
 FontSize->24],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Goal:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Given a network (a graph with capacity constraints), find the maximum flow \
from the start (s) to the finish (t)\n",
 StyleBox["Problem:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Every figure takes long to draw, algorithm requires keeping track of many \
features."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4832844335644207`*^9, 3.4832844681647253`*^9}, {
